### GetBillingOverviewResponse



<ResponseField name="entitlementsVersion" type={"integer"} required>
Bumps on every entitlement change in any category.
</ResponseField>

<ResponseField name="subscriptions" type={"array of ProjectSubscription"} required>
One entry per category that currently holds a subscription. Empty means none do — cancelled, or never opened.
</ResponseField>

<ResponseField name="usage" type={"array of MeteredUsage"} required>
Current-period metered usage, priced.
</ResponseField>


